# sent_id = orat23.3.5
# text = Norunt mentem viri aulici et philosophi ipsiusque circa religionem sententias, quibus virum penitius nosse contigit.) Doch um hierüber urtheilen zu können, ist es erforderlich, das Verhältnifs zu bestimmen, welches Leibniz in der Theodicee der Philosophie und der positiven Religion oder positiven Theologie gegen einander anweist, und wie er sich als Philosoph gegen letztere stellt.
# reading_translation = (The courtiers and the philosopher know his mind and his views concerning religion, since it has fallen to them to know the man more intimately.) Yet in order to be able to judge of this, it is necessary to determine the relation which Leibniz in the Theodicy assigns to philosophy and to positive religion, or positive theology, with respect to one another, and how he, as a philosopher, positions himself toward the latter.
