# sent_id = orat23.5.23
# text = An welchen Dingen allen gewissenhaften Menschen, sonderlich hohen Potentaten, denen vieler Menschen Wohlfahrt zu verantworten, höchlich gelegen." In dieser Beziehung dient also die Philosophie oder Vernunft dem Glauben, statt ihm entgegen zu sein, wie er auch selber im Anfange *) Man bemerke das „harmonia universalis, id est Deus"; vgl. Erdmann Gesch. d. neuern Philos.
# reading_translation = In how many things, indeed, are conscientious people, and especially high potentates, to whom the welfare of many people is to be answered for, supremely concerned." In this respect, therefore, philosophy or reason serves faith, instead of being opposed to it, as it [faith] itself at the beginning *) Note the "harmonia universalis, id est Deus"; cf. Erdmann, History of Modern Philosophy.
