# sent_id = orat23.7.18
# text = Daſs er aber nicht jedes Dogma, welches er objectiv aufnahm und logisch vertheidigte, zu seiner subjectiven Ueberzeugung gemacht hatte, glaubten Männer wie Pfaff zu wissen, und was dieser darüber sagt, kann schwerlich auf nichts beruhen; ja er selber mochte wohl, als er jenen Brief an Pfaff schrieb, sich erinnern, dafs er manchem Dogma das Wort geredet habe, ohne die Beweggründe der Glaubwürdigkeit in Betracht zu ziehen, dafs er dabei etwas im Hinterhalt behalten, auch wohl dabei einige Ironie empfunden habe.
# reading_translation = But that he had not made every dogma that he objectively accepted and logically defended into his own subjective conviction, men like Pfaff believed they knew; and what the latter says about this can scarcely rest on nothing. Indeed, he himself, when he wrote that letter to Pfaff, may well have recalled that he had spoken in favor of many a dogma without taking into consideration the grounds of its credibility, that he had kept something in reserve in doing so, and had perhaps even felt some irony in the process.
