# sent_id = orat29.3.4
# text = Denn auch im Innern war zu seiner Zeit viel aufzuräumen und einzurichten; und es ist sehr zweifelhaft, ob was er als Alleinherrscher nützliches gewirkt hat, in einer freieren Regierungsform zu Stande gekommen wäre, und ob die Fehler, in welche er verfallen ist, dann würden vermieden worden sein, da die Grundsätze, aus denen sie hervorgingen, seinem Zeitalter mit ihm gemeinsam waren.
# reading_translation = For in his time there was also much to set in order and to arrange in domestic affairs; and it is very doubtful whether what he accomplished as sole ruler would have come about under a freer form of government, and whether the errors into which he fell would then have been avoided, since the principles from which they arose were shared by his age along with him.
