# sent_id = orat33.1.19
# text = Leicht knüpft sich hieran auch, zumal wenn man von Plutarchischen Parallelen herkommt, die Frage, ob seine rein geistige Wirkung seiner kriegerischen die Wage halte oder ob wir uns fortan nur an Friedrich den Meister des Krieges und den Sieger zu halten haben und der Philosoph von Sanssouci preiszugeben sei.
# reading_translation = Closely connected with this, too, is the question—especially when one comes to it from Plutarch's Parallel Lives—whether his purely intellectual influence holds its own against his military influence, or whether from now on we are to concern ourselves only with Frederick the master of war and the victor, and the philosopher of Sanssouci is to be abandoned.
