# sent_id = orat35.2.10
# text = Was aus den ältesten, heiligsten Traditionen geworden ist; - doctrina per tot manus tradita tandem in vappam desiit!" Wie es überhaupt in der Geschichte der Philosophie Beispiele gebe von Systemen, die mehre Zeitalter hindurch räthselhaft geblieben, so sei erst jetzt die Zeit gekommen, Leibnizen zu verstehen ; denn so wie er bisher verstanden worden, könne er nicht verstanden werden, wenn er, wie jemand damals gesagt hatte, im Grunde doch Recht haben solle*).
# reading_translation = What has become of the oldest, holiest traditions; — doctrina per tot manus tradita tandem in vappam desiit! Just as in the history of philosophy there are in general examples of systems that have remained enigmatic through several ages, so only now has the time come to understand Leibniz; for as he has hitherto been understood, he cannot be understood, if, as someone said at the time, he is after all to be right at bottom*).
